OL,3,GNEWSADemolition begins on high street
OL,4,Aafter two false starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal businesses are raising concerns
OL,7,Fthat the demolition of two buildings,
OL,8,Fthat has been postponed twice, is
OL,9,Fimpacting trade.
OL,11,FThe commercial premises on Market
OL,12,FStreet, Longton, Stoke-on-Trent are
OL,13,Fbeing levelled after two fires broke
OL,14,Fout towards the end of 2025, requiring
OL,15,Fup to 30 firefighters to attend.
OL,17,FPlans to demolish the buildings in July
OL,18,Fwere abandoned twice but road closures
OL,19,Fremained in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
