OL,3,GNEWSADemolition begins on high street
OL,4,Aafter two false starts
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Chris Robinson told the BBC
OL,7,Fthe first cancellation was due to a
OL,8,Fcontractor not filing the correct
OL,9,Fpaperwork, while the second
OL,10,Fpostponement was because it coincided
OL,11,Fwith regeneration work in the area.
